<title>UK: Credit Communal Belgique signs $4.0 bln global CP.</title>
<headline>Credit Communal Belgique signs $4.0 bln global CP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Communal de Belgique has signed for a $4.0 billion global commercial paper programme, Lehman Brothers International said as arranger on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Credit Communal de Belgique will be guarantor and Cregem North America Inc will be issuer for the programme which will be rated P1 by Moody's Investors Service and A1+ by Standard and Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
